# The Reading Room

A small, account-free reading tracker. Add books and notes, mark books as finished, and copy a link to an individual book.

## Run locally

Requires Node.js 18 or newer.

"'```sh
npm start
```

Open http://localhost:3000. Set `PORT` to use another port. Books are saved in `data/books.json` and persist when the server restarts. You can set `BOOKS_FILE` to use a different JSON file.

A book link is available to anyone who can reach this running app; a localhost link only works on your own computer. Notes are included on the book page.
